<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: EGO Carapace -->
  <EGO_Armor_Carapace.label>EGO甲壳</EGO_Armor_Carapace.label>
  <!-- EN: Specially gestated amalgam Carapace, perfectly protects the owner. Designed for use by Undyings. Amalgams are hybrids of EGO seed and Obsidia technology.\n\nThe item's quality levels can be reset using an EGO Seed. -->
  <EGO_Armor_Carapace.description>特殊培育的融合体甲壳，完美地保护穿戴者。专为不死者设计。融合体是EGO种子与黑曜石科技的混合体。\n\n该物品的品质等级可以使用EGO种子重置。</EGO_Armor_Carapace.description>
  
  <!-- EN: EGO Shell(Berserker) -->
  <EGO_Armor_Shell_Melee.label>EGO外壳（狂战士）</EGO_Armor_Shell_Melee.label>
  <!-- EN: Specially gestated amalgam Shell, excellent protects the owner. Designed for use by Undyings. Amalgams are hybrids of EGO seed and Obsidia technology.\n\nThis modification improve melee combat stats and modified with the addition of a Smokepop pack.\n\nThe item's quality levels can be reset using an EGO Seed. -->
  <EGO_Armor_Shell_Melee.description>特殊培育的融合体外壳，出色地保护穿戴者。专为不死者设计。融合体是EGO种子与黑曜石科技的混合体。\n\n此改装提高了近战战斗属性并增加了烟雾弹背包。\n\n该物品的品质等级可以使用EGO种子重置。</EGO_Armor_Shell_Melee.description>
  <!-- EN: smokepop -->
  <EGO_Armor_Shell_Melee.comps.CompApparelReloadable.chargeNoun>烟雾弹</EGO_Armor_Shell_Melee.comps.CompApparelReloadable.chargeNoun>
  <!-- EN: on cooldown -->
  <EGO_Armor_Shell_Melee.comps.CompApparelReloadable.cooldownGerund>冷却中</EGO_Armor_Shell_Melee.comps.CompApparelReloadable.cooldownGerund>
  <!-- EN: EGO Shell(Berserker) -->
  <EGO_Armor_Shell_Melee.verbs.Verb_SmokePop.label>EGO外壳（狂战士）</EGO_Armor_Shell_Melee.verbs.Verb_SmokePop.label>
  
